'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond#Page 1|Righteous Revenants]] Legendary [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Acclimated}}

==Trivia==
*This armor is part of the [[Killzone]] crossover, designed to mirror the [https://killzone.fandom.com/Assault_Infantry Assault Infantry.]
*The body armor and [[helmet]] could previously be bought from the ‘Premium [[Superstore]]’ for a whopping {{Currency|SC|500|notext}} and 310 [[Super Credits]], respectively! Later on these items were bundled together into the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond]].
**The items in this Premium Superstore rotation were originally scheduled to be removed after five days; however, due to player concerns over missing out ({{Tooltip|FOMO|Fear of Missing Out}}), the developers extended their availability to ten days.

